      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I think we want it before M_SET_ZYGOTE_CHILD, not after.\n\nLooking back, it doesn\u0027t actually matter. gwp_asan_initialize (see other patchset) in libc will always be run with *zygote_child \u003d\u003d false, and we initialise through the common mallopt() anyway.\n\n\u003e Also, why not do the initialization in M_SET_ZYGOTE_CHILD itself?\n\nWe use mallopt(M_INITIALIZE_GWP_ASAN) as the common entry pathway, and I think it\u0027s a little clearer to explicitly say in the Zygote that this is what\u0027s happening, rather than hide it behind M_SET_ZYGOTE_CHILD.",
